    "description_en": "Annual aquaculture production in Malaysia and its wholesale and retail value by environment and species.",
    "description_ms": "Pengeluaran akuakultur tahunan di Malaysia serta nilai borong dan nilai runcitnya mengikut persekitaran dan spesies.",
